<!doctype html><html lang="pt"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Modelos editoriais · Usina Docs</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;margin:2rem;max-width:1000px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1rem}.card{border:1px solid #ccd4e0;border-radius:.7rem;padding:1rem}.tag{display:inline-block;background:#e8f2fb;color:#24557a;border-radius:999px;padding:.15rem .45rem;margin:.2rem;font-size:.85rem}.required{font-weight:700}.actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem}.actions form{margin:0}</style><body><main><p><a href="/admin">← Painel editorial</a></p><h1>Modelos editoriais</h1><p>Modelos definem a estrutura sugerida de uma página. Alterações são preparadas em rascunhos versionados.</p><p><a href="/admin/models/new">Criar modelo</a></p><div class="grid">{% for model in models %}<article class="card"><h2>{{ model.label }}</h2><p><code>{{ model.content_type }}</code></p><p>{{ model.description }}</p><h3>Artefatos</h3>{% for artifact in model.artifacts %}<span class="tag {% if artifact.required %}required{% endif %}">{{ artifact.label }}{% if artifact.required %} · essencial{% endif %}</span>{% endfor %}<div class="actions"><a href="/admin/models/{{ model.id }}/history">Histórico</a>{% if model.has_draft %}<a href="/admin/models/{{ model.id }}/edit">Editar rascunho</a><form method="post" action="/admin/models/{{ model.id }}/publish"><button>Publicar</button></form>{% else %}<form method="post" action="/admin/models/{{ model.id }}/revisions"><button>Criar revisão</button></form>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div></main></body></html>
